## 13. Verify SonarQube from the Command Line

Run:

```bash
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:9000/api/system/status
```

A healthy installation should return a response containing:

```json
{"status":"UP"}
```

Check container resource usage:

```bash
docker stats --no-stream
```

Check disk usage:

```bash
df -h
docker system df
```

