## 15. Back Up the PostgreSQL Database

Create a backup directory:

```bash
mkdir -p /opt/sonarqube/backups
```

Create a compressed database backup:

```bash
cd /opt/sonarqube

docker compose exec -T db \
pg_dump -U sonarqube sonarqube |
gzip > backups/sonarqube-db-$(date +%F-%H%M).sql.gz
```

Verify the backup:

```bash
ls -lh /opt/sonarqube/backups/
```

