- [ ] VM has preferably 8 GB RAM
- [ ] VM has at least 30 GB disk
- [ ] Docker Engine is installed
- [ ] Docker Compose is installed
- [ ] `vm.max_map_count` is set to `524288`
- [ ] `fs.file-max` is set to `131072`
- [ ] PostgreSQL container is healthy
- [ ] SonarQube container is running
- [ ] TCP port `9000` is open
- [ ] SonarQube opens in the browser
- [ ] Default administrator password has been changed
- [ ] Database backup has been tested
- [ ] `.env` is protected and not committed to Git

